	(text "MIA-M10Q, 1.8 V design (VCC = V_IO, VIO_SEL to GND). u-blox requires 1.8 V +-2%: nPM1300 buck is +-5%,\nso GNSS_1V8 comes from a TPS62840 buck (+-1.5%) off VSYS, EN = GNSS_EN with 1M pull-down (also powers GNSS down).\nTX_READY on PIO6 (F7), configure via CFG-TXREADY. No RTC crystal: RTC_O to GND, RTC_I open. D2-E2 tied."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
